AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherAlIntro::
	.string "Bug POKéMON are cool and tough!\n"
	.string "I’ll prove it to you!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherAlDefeat::
	.string "You proved how tough you are...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherAl::
	.string "They’re so cool, but most girls\n"
	.string "don’t like bug POKéMON.\l"
	.string "I don’t know why...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherJoshIntro::
	.string "You saved all the SLOWPOKE? Whew,\n"
	.string "you’re mighty!\p"
	.string "But my grown-up POKéMON are pretty\n"
	.string "tough too!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherJoshDefeat::
	.string "Urrgggh!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherJosh::
	.string "I guess I should teach them better\n"
	.string "moves...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherBennyIntro::
	.string "Bug POKéMON evolve young. So they\n"
	.string "get stronger that much faster.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherBennyDefeat::
	.string "Just evolving isn’t enough!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_BugCatcherBenny::
	.string "POKéMON become stronger if they\n"
	.string "evolve. Really!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_LeaderBugsyIntro::
	.string "I’m BUGSY!\n"
	.string "I never lose when it comes to bug\l"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "My research is going to make me\n"
	.string "the authority on bug POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Let me demonstrate what I’ve\n"
	.string "learned from my studies.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_LeaderBugsyDefeat::
	.string "Whoa, amazing!\n"
	.string "You’re an expert on POKéMON!\p"
	.string "My research isn’t complete yet.\p"
	.string "OK, you win. Take this BADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the HIVEBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_LeaderBugsy_1::
	.string "Bug POKéMON are deep. There are\n"
	.string "many mysteries to be explored.\p"
	.string "Study your favorites thoroughly.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_LeaderBugsy_2::
	.string "Do you know the benefits of\n"
	.string "HIVEBADGE?\p"
	.string "If you have it, POKéMON up to L30\n"
	.string "will obey you.\p"
	.string "POKéMON that know CUT will be able\n"
	.string "to use it outside of battle too.\p"
	.string "Here, I also want you to have this.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_LeaderBugsy_3::
	.string "TM49 contains FURY CUTTER.\p"
	.string "If you don’t miss, it gets stronger\n"
	.string "every turn.\p"
	.string "The longer your battle goes, the\n"
	.string "better it gets.\p"
	.string "Isn’t that great?\n"
	.string "I discovered it!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo, challenger!\p"
	.string "BUGSY’s young, but his knowledge of\n"
	.string "bug POKéMON is for real.\p"
	.string "It’s going to be tough without my\n"
	.string "advice.\p"
	.string "Let’s see... Bug POKéMON don’t like\n"
	.string "fire.\p"
	.string "Flying-type moves are super-effective\n"
	.string "too.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Well done! That was a great clash\n"
	.string "of talented young trainers.\p"
	.string "With people like you, the future of\n"
	.string "POKéMON is bright!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHost_1::
	.string "Hmmm, this GYM was too easy...\p"
	.string "...You again...\p"
	.string "Well, since my POKéMON still has\n"
	.string "energy I could use a little\l"
	.string "practice...\p"
	.string "Why don’t we do a double battle this\n"
	.string "time, what do you say?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHost_2::
	.string "...Yeah, I knew it.\p"
	.string "Perhaps we’ll battle some other\n"
	.string "time...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHost_3::
	.string "Whatever...\p"
	.string "Even a weakling like you should win\n"
	.string "in this pathetic GYM.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHost_4::
	.string "Aren’t you supposed to be battling\n"
	.string "the GYM LEADER?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHost_5::
	.string "OK. But this time I’ll win!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHostDefeat::
	.string "Hmmm...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TeachyTvHost_6::
	.string "I know what I did wrong...\p"
	.string "I need to catch a few more POKéMON.\p"
	.string "All right, I’m going to stay here\n"
	.string "to watch your battle.\p"
	.string "So you better show me something\n"
	.string "good!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TwinsAmyAndMayIntro::
	.string "AMY: Hi! Are you challenging the\n"
	.string "LEADER? No way!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TwinsAmyAndMayDefeat::
	.string "AMY & MAY: Oh, double goodness!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TwinsAmyAndMay::
	.string "AMY: You’re really strong!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TwinsAmyAndMay2Intro::
	.string "MAY: You want to see the LEADER?\n"
	.string "We come first!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_TwinsAmyAndMay2::
	.string "MAY: Our bug POKéMON lost!, Oh, what\n"
	.string "a shame.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "AZALEA TOWN POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: BUGSY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "CARLOS$"

AzaleaTown_Interior6_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "AZALEA TOWN POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: BUGSY\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "CARLOS {PLAYER}$"
